  "body": "Entry Level Coastal Living with Sea Views & Rangitoto Zone \r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of coveted Rothesay Bay, this elevated2-bedroom unit offers an unbeatable entry point into one of North Shore's premier coastal suburbs. Time tested brick and block construction represents low maintenance living with a genuine potential to upgrade further.\r\n\r\n•  Polished Matai flooring and a living environment that enjoys elevated sweeping sea and urban views.\r\n\r\n• Huge tandem basement garage/workshop space for secure parking and storage of all your beach gear. \r\n\r\n• Explore the coastal walkways and enjoy the local cafes, restaurant and beaches, just moments away.\r\n\r\n• Top school Zones of Murrays Bay and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nOur vendor is highly motivated to sell thus providing the perfect opportunity for the first home buyer and investors looking for a bulletproof investment in a top location.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
